# Safe baseline security headers. Deliberately NO Content-Security-Policy here: Razorpay checkout, YouTube, Instagram, Supabase
# and Google Fonts are all loaded by the pages, and a wrong CSP would break payments or embeds. Add one only after testing it
# against the live booking and payment flow. HTTPS and HSTS are provided by Netlify.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
